5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's get this started. Since we have no information, I'll just observe for now.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,I agree. It is too early to make any accusations.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
