31,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Now we have a chance to narrow things down. Anyone notice anything strange?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,Not yet. We have had no deaths and no claims.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Um... I actually know something! Takumi is the werewolf!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! That's a lie! Why are you blaming me, Yumi?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,That was a very sudden and bold claim.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"If Yumi is the Seer, this is a very straightforward start.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, I am the Seer! I checked Takumi last night and he's the wolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,She's lying! I'm a villager! You can't trust her!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is unusual to reveal the Seer's identity so early, but it is efficient.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Takumi, your reaction is quite aggressive. It makes you look suspicious.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,I tend to trust the Seer's divination if they are willing to risk their life.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Please believe me! I want to protect everyone!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@George, don't just listen to her! She's trying to trick us!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,The evidence is currently one-sided.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm inclined to believe Yumi. Takumi, your defense is weak.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. I will vote for Takumi.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, George!","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,This is unfair! You're all making a mistake!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the majority for the sake of the village.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
